<title>USA: NYCE sets record cotton volume and FCOJ options.</title>
<headline>NYCE sets record cotton volume and FCOJ options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Cotton Exchange said it set two daily records Nov 21 -- the highest cotton futures volume of 31,618 lots and the largest total options open interest in frozen concentrated orange juice of 56,311 contracts.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
